WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.213
A 27-billion-parameter

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:03.074
model that fits

00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:04.831
in 5.9 gigabytes

00:00:05.358 --> 00:00:07.362
Ternary Bonsai 2.5

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.317
keeps the previous

00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:10.275
release's 5.9 gigabyte

00:00:10.087 --> 00:00:11.501
footprint while improving

00:00:11.313 --> 00:00:12.987
the capabilities developers

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:13.577
need to build

00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:14.379
agents that work

00:00:14.191 --> 00:00:15.063
on-device

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:16.753
Compared with Bonsai

00:00:16.565 --> 00:00:17.131
2

00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:18.510
it completes tasks

00:00:18.322 --> 00:00:19.371
in fewer turns

00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:20.951
uses fewer tokens

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.095
and delivers results

00:00:21.907 --> 00:00:23.227
faster and more

00:00:23.039 --> 00:00:23.829
accurately

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.151
On a single

00:00:24.963 --> 00:00:26.555
NVIDIA H100

00:00:26.744 --> 00:00:28.724
it generates 291

00:00:28.536 --> 00:00:29.680
tokens per second

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:30.918
and processes a

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.215
2,000-token prompt

00:00:32.039 --> 00:00:34.196
at 3,200 tokens

00:00:34.008 --> 00:00:34.868
per second

00:00:35.406 --> 00:00:36.420
Full story on

00:00:36.231 --> 00:00:37.127
the dashboard
